<events>
- enter — Start a new instance of a state machine, or continue one.
    stateMachine (required, one of: dev, help): The state machine to enter.
    issueId | ref (optional): The id param its state machine names above: an existing id or ref continues that instance, a new ref starts one with it; omit to start a new one.
    state (optional): Enter here instead: an entry point. Omit for the initial state (new) or the saved state (existing).
- listPaused — List all 12 paused instances, most recently updated first.
